sequenceDiagram
    participant Visitor as Visitante (Kiosk)
    participant UI as Kiosk UI (Next.js)
    participant OtpAPI as API (/api/otp)
    participant ValidateAPI as API (/api/otp/validate)
    participant ConsentAPI as API (/api/consentimientos)
    participant AuthSvc as authService
    participant ConsentSvc as consentService
    participant FS as Firestore
    participant Storage as Firebase Storage
    participant Mail as Resend

    Visitor->>UI: Ingresa documento y correo asociado
    UI->>OtpAPI: Solicitar OTP
    OtpAPI->>AuthSvc: requestOtpChallenge(...)
    AuthSvc->>FS: Leer/escribir otp_challenges
    AuthSvc->>Mail: Enviar OTP
    Mail-->>Visitor: Código OTP por correo
    OtpAPI-->>UI: OK / rate-limited / locked

    Visitor->>UI: Ingresa OTP recibido
    UI->>ValidateAPI: Validar OTP
    ValidateAPI->>AuthSvc: validateOtpChallengeRequest(...)
    AuthSvc->>FS: Validar otp_challenges
    AuthSvc->>FS: Crear otp_access_sessions (split model)
    AuthSvc->>FS: Fallback legacy otp_sessions si aplica
    ValidateAPI-->>UI: Acceso validado / error / lockout

    alt Flujo online normal
        Visitor->>UI: Firma consentimiento
        UI->>ConsentAPI: POST /api/consentimientos
        ConsentAPI->>AuthSvc: verifyOtpSession(userId)
        AuthSvc->>FS: Leer otp_access_sessions / fallback otp_sessions
        ConsentAPI->>ConsentSvc: createConsent(...)
        ConsentSvc->>Storage: Guardar firma
        ConsentSvc->>FS: Crear consent + actualizar users/minors_index + contador
        ConsentAPI-->>UI: 201 consentId/consecutivo
    else Flujo offline diferido
        UI->>UI: Guardar payload en cola local
        UI-->>Visitor: Confirmación local / pendiente de sync
        UI->>ConsentAPI: Reintento al volver online
        ConsentAPI->>ConsentSvc: createConsent(...offlineSync)
        ConsentSvc->>FS: Resolver offline_sync/{dedupeKey}
        ConsentSvc->>FS: Reusar ack previo o crear consentimiento idempotente
        ConsentAPI-->>UI: ACK idempotente / conflicto controlado
    end
